#### :lock: Another run holds the deploy lock

kix deploy by ana@laptop, process 7 holds the deploy lock (deploy of prod-abc), renewed 6s ago. While that run holds the lock, this plan leaves out what earlier failed or partial deploys applied.

> Made by a read-only comparison with the cluster. Not checked: admission webhooks, admission policies, field ownership conflicts, and invalid objects; `kix plan` checks them.
